  COLUMNS            = 2                                                      
  DESCRIPTION        = "                                                      
    This table provides the wavelength-dependent solar spectrum for           
    converting global-mode radiance data to reflectance.  This is an          
    exo-atmospheric solar spectrum at 1 AU as determined with MODTRAN.        
    For more information see G. P. Anderson et al. (2000) Proc. SPIE,         
    4049, 176-183 [ANDERSONETAL2000] and R. L. Kurucz (1995), Proceedings     
    of the 17th Annual Review Conference on Atmospheric Transmission          
    Models, 333-334 [KURUCZ1995]."                                            
                                                                              
